’s own types, so algorithms run at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"base’s speed and data kept by position stays valid through the wrapper. The wrapper implements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every mutation itself (that is where its rules are), and its non-requirement members."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphDelegator","title":"GraphDelegator","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GraphDelegator","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}